DS_T14B_1132_en_B_0625_VIEW.inddT14 B
Capacity 1.4 t | Series 1132
Pallet Trucks
Agile indoor assistant
 â†’ Compact electric pallet truck for light to medium duty tasks indoors
 â†’ Nominal load capacity of 1.4 tonnes, ideal for horizontal transport of goods
 â†’ Intended for short distance use in retail, warehousing and industrial supply applications
 â†’ Ergonomic design allows precise, effortless operation
 â†’ Running time of 3-4 hours per battery charge ensures high availability
